data:
This is the first one i've spent actual money on. They got me.

I've tried a whole bunch of other gachas - from Genshin to WuWa with the original intent of trying the genre at all is being able to play on both on PC and mobile - and this is the one I have well over 100 hours in (pre-steam PC + mobile).

It has, i don't wanna say "good", but not a "bad" either, story;
Actually awesome boss fights i've enjoyed;
Some out of this world level designs within the main story, and sometimes outside of it too;
Great visuals;
Fun enough combat;
A bunch of nice activities;
Fair gacha system, probably best in class.

Cons?
FOMO. A lot of it. I want it all xD

The devs keep adding cool things in a timely manner, i only hope they can keep up with the quality of the content long term.
